<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ns1="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Nambah Wilangan Cacah</title>
<metadata>
  <ns1:content-id>m81244</ns1:content-id>
  <ns1:title>Nambah Wilangan Cacah</ns1:title>
  <ns1:abstract><para id="para-00001">Sawise sinau bagean iki, kowe bakal bisa:</para><list id="list-00001">
<item>Nganggo notasi panambahan</item>
<item>Nggambarake panambahan wilangan cacah nganggo model</item>
<item>Nambah wilangan cacah tanpa model</item>
<item>Ngowahi frasa tembung dadi notasi matematika</item>
<item>Nganggo panambahan wilangan cacah ing kahanan nyata</item>
</list></ns1:abstract>
  <ns1:uuid>8069044b-6fb1-49bf-b03a-64988f9b1ddd</ns1:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
<note id="fs-id2299412" class="be-prepared">
<para id="fs-id2646470">Sadurunge miwiti, ayo nggarap kuis kesiapan iki.</para>
<exercise id="fs-idm207409024">
<problem id="fs-idm215457168">
<para id="fs-idm214637312">Wilangan pira sing digambarake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>?<newline />
<media id="fs-id2778433" alt="Gambar iki ana telung bagean. Sing kapisan rong persegi, saben persegi ngemot 100 blok, ambane 10 blok lan dhuwure 10 blok. Sing kapindho siji batang horisontal sing ngemot 10 blok. Sing katelu ana 5 blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_001_img.jpg" />
</media><newline />
Yen wangsulanmu salah, sinaunen maneh <link target-id="fs-id2222880" document="m81243" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm219309424">
<para id="fs-idm216142416"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1122444" class="be-prepared">
<exercise id="fs-idm218505136">
<problem id="fs-idm221149472">
<para id="fs-idm218825920">Tulisen telung atus patang puluh loro éwu enem nganggo digit.<newline />
Yen wangsulanmu salah, sinaunen maneh <link target-id="fs-id3202693" document="m81243" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm207579776">
<para id="fs-idm221421664"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>342</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>006</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<section id="fs-id2601285">
<title>Nganggo Notasi Panambahan</title>
<para id="fs-id3165690">Ana mahasiswa sing nyambut gawe paruh wektu. Minggu kepungkur dheweke nyambut gawe <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> jam ing dina Senen lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> jam ing dina Jemuwah. Kanggo ngerti gunggung jam kerjane minggu kepungkur, dheweke nambahake <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id2606793">Operasi panambahan nggabungake wilangan kanggo entuk <term id="term-00001">gunggung</term>. Notasi sing dienggo kanggo nggoleki gunggung <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> yaiku:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1474530" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id2619407">Iki diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">telu ditambah papat</emphasis>, lan asile gunggung telu lan papat. Wilangan <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> diarani suku-suku panambahan. Pranyatan matematika sing ana wilangan lan operasine diarani ekspresi.</para><note id="fs-id1282344">
<title>Notasi Panambahan</title>
<para id="fs-id1966740">Kanggo nerangake panambahan, kita bisa nganggo tandha lan tembung.</para>
<table id="fs-id2711498" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana rong baris lan limang kolom. Baris paling ndhuwur isine judhul. Saka kiwa menyang tengen, judhul kolome Operasi, Notasi, Ekspresi, Diwaca, lan Asil. Ing baris kapindho, saka kiwa menyang tengen, ana panambahan, tandha tambah, ekspresi 3 ditambah 4, wacan telu ditambah papat, lan gunggung 3 lan 4.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Notasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry align="left">Diwaca</entry>
<entry align="left">Asil</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">telu ditambah papat</entry>
<entry align="left">gunggung <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1519902">
<exercise id="fs-id2294573"><problem id="fs-id1330068">
<para id="fs-id2703725">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung:<list id="eip-id1168287109262" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2294519">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title><list id="eip-id1168287334447" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Ing ekspresi iki, tandha tambah nyambungake suku panambahan 7 lan 1. Iki diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">pitu ditambah siji</emphasis>. Asile <emphasis effect="italics">gunggung pitu lan siji</emphasis>.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Ing ekspresi iki, tandha tambah nyambungake suku panambahan 12 lan 14. Iki diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">rolas ditambah patbelas</emphasis>. Asile <emphasis effect="italics">gunggung rolas lan patbelas</emphasis>.</item></list></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2202625" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1386428"><problem id="fs-id2842881">
<para id="fs-id1549906">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168289469583" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1948344"><list id="eip-id1168288479736" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> wolu ditambah papat; gunggung wolu lan papat</item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> wolulas ditambah sewelas; gunggung wolulas lan sewelas</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id2216255" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2334163"><problem id="fs-id1525211">
<para id="fs-id1630183">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168289631763" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>200</m:mn></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1577525"><list id="eip-id1168288338262" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> selikur ditambah nembelas; gunggung selikur lan nembelas</item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> satus ditambah rong atus; gunggung satus lan rong atus</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
</section>
<section id="fs-id2145437"><title>Nggambarake Panambahan Wilangan Cacah nganggo Model</title><para id="fs-id1484984">Panambahan kuwi sejatine ngetung. Kita bakal nggambarake panambahan nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Elinga, siji blok makili <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan siji batang makili <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Ayo nggambarake ekspresi panambahan sing lagi wae dirembug, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1567091">Saben suku panambahan luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> mula kita bisa nganggo blok satuan.</para>
<table id="eip-167" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom: sing kiwa isine katrangan, sing tengen isine blok basis-10. Baris kapisan ngajak kita nggambarake wilangan kapisan nganggo telung blok, banjur nuduhake 3 blok satuan kanthi label 3 ing ngisore. Baris sabanjure ngajak nggambarake wilangan kapindho nganggo patang blok, banjur nuduhake klompok 3 blok lan klompok 4 blok kanthi label 3 lan 4. Baris pungkasan ngajak ngetung gunggung kabeh blok, banjur nuduhake 7 blok satuan kanthi label 7.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Wiwitane, kita nggambarake wilangan kapisan nganggo 3 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288475996" alt="Ana telung persegi kosong ing ndhuwur digit 3, latare putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_019_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Banjur, wilangan kapindho digambarake nganggo 4 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288501014" alt="Ana rong klompok persegi kosong. Sing kapisan ana telung persegi kanthi label '3', sing kapindho ana patang persegi kanthi label '4'. Gambar iki nuduhake dhasar ngetung utawa nglompokake."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_019_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen kabeh bloke.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288501034" alt="Digit '7' ana ing ngisor barisan pitung persegi kosong."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_019_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1607848">Kabeh ana <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> blok. Kita nganggo tandha padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>(=)</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> kanggo nuduhake gunggung. Ukara matematika sing nuduhake yen rong ekspresi nilaine padha diarani persamaan. Dadi, kita wis nuduhake yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para><note id="fs-id1171103645619" class="manipulative-math">Nggarap kegiatan lembar kerja matematika manipulatif “Nggambarake Panambahan Wilangan Cacah nganggo Model” bakal mbantu kowe luwih ngerti panambahan wilangan cacah.</note><example id="fs-id1239606"><exercise id="fs-id1471255"><problem id="fs-id3961697">
<para id="fs-id1899387">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1969376">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1883656"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> tegese gunggung <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math>.</para><para id="eip-id1170195494564">Saben suku panambahan luwih cilik tinimbang 10, mula kita bisa nganggo blok satuan.</para>

<table id="eip-951" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom: sing kiwa isine katrangan, sing tengen isine blok basis-10. Baris kapisan ngajak nggambarake wilangan kapisan nganggo 2 blok lan nuduhake rong blok satuan kanthi label 2. Baris kapindho ngajak nggambarake wilangan kapindho nganggo 6 blok lan nuduhake klompok 2 blok kanthi label 2, kapisah saka klompok enem blok kanthi label 6. Baris pungkasan ngajak ngetung kabeh blok lan nuduhake wolung blok satuan kanthi label 8."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>

  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna wilangan kapisan nganggo 2 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287484993" alt="Ana rong persegi kanthi bingkai biru enom ing ndhuwur wilangan 2, nuduhake rong barang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_016_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna wilangan kapindho nganggo 6 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287042738" alt="Gambar nuduhake rong persegi biru enom ing ndhuwur wilangan 2 lan enem persegi biru enom ing ndhuwur wilangan 6."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_016_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen kabeh bloke.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287554343" alt="Gambar nuduhake wolung persegi biru enom ing ndhuwur wilangan 8."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_016_img-04.png" /></media><newline />Kabeh ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok, mula <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>

</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1718496" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2792546">
<problem id="fs-id1404551">
<para id="fs-id1395632">Gambarna nganggo model: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1833338">
<para id="fs-id1171103910560"><newline /><media id="fs-id2198152" alt="Gambar nuduhake telung persegi klawu, banjur sela kosong, banjur enem persegi klawu maneh. Ing ngisore ana persamaan matematika '3 + 6 = 9' sing nuduhake gunggung persegi mau.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_006_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2454904" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1886370">
<problem id="fs-id1374158">
<para id="fs-id1202710">Gambarna nganggo model: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1241970">
<para id="fs-id1171105209419"><newline /><media id="fs-id1790053" alt="Gambar nganggo persegi klawu kanggo nggambarake soal panambahan 5 + 1.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_007_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1825926">Yen asile ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok satuan utawa luwih, kita bakal ngijolake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok karo siji batang.</para>
<example id="fs-id998472"><exercise id="fs-id1792383">
<problem id="fs-id1569336">
<para id="fs-id1550016">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1471782">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1171103442800"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> tegese gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>

<table id="eip-555" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom. Sing kiwa isine katrangan, sing tengen isine blok basis-10. Baris kapisan ngajak nggambarake wilangan kapisan nganggo limang blok, banjur nuduhake limang blok satuan kanthi label 5. Baris kapindho ngajak nggambarake wilangan kapindho nganggo 8 blok, banjur nuduhake klompok 5 blok lan klompok 8 blok kanthi label 5 lan 8. Baris sabanjure ngajak ngetung asile. Amarga ana luwih saka 10 blok, 10 blok satuan diijolake karo 1 batang puluhan; sepuluh blok wiwitan dikupengi garis lan dituduhake menyang siji batang basis-10 abang, dene telung blok biru isih kari. Baris pungkasan nerangake yen saiki ana 1 puluhan lan 3 satuan, yaiku 13.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Saben suku panambahan luwih cilik tinimbang 10, mula kita bisa nganggo blok satuan.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna wilangan kapisan nganggo 5 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288219210" alt="Gambar nuduhake limang persegi kosong klawu enom kanthi garis pinggir peteng, disusun horisontal. Wilangan '5' ana pas ing ngisor tengahing limang persegi, latare putih, kanggo nuduhake cacahe."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_017_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna wilangan kapindho nganggo 8 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288219228" alt="Gambar nuduhake 5 persegi klawu kanthi bingkai lan wilangan 5 ing ngisore, uga klompok wolung persegi klawu kanthi bingkai lan wilangan 8 ing ngisore."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_017_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen asile. Ana luwih saka 10 blok, dadi 10 blok satuan diijolake karo 1 batang puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288217527" alt="Gambar nuduhake rong klompok, saben klompok ana 5 persegi klawu kanthi bingkai, lan siji klompok 3 persegi klawu kanthi bingkai. Rong klompok isi 5 persegi dikupengi garis banjur diowahi dadi siji klompok 10 blok abang ing ngisore. Klompok telung persegi klawu ana ing sandhinge."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_017_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Saiki kita duwe 1 puluhan lan 3 satuan, yaiku 13.</entry>
    <entry>5 + 8 = 13</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table><para id="eip-571">Bagean model bisa disebut blok satuan lan batang puluhan, utawa cekake <emphasis effect="italics">satuan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">puluhan</emphasis>. Sabanjure kita bakal nganggo sebutan cekak kuwi, nanging elinga, tegese padha.</para></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1762424" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2265162">
<problem id="fs-id2562850">
<para id="fs-id1827907">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2140822">
<para id="fs-id1171105511335"><newline /><media id="fs-id4346927" alt="Gambar nganggo blok kanggo nuduhake soal panambahan 5 + 7.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_010_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1408852" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1863239">
<problem id="fs-id2496120">
<para id="fs-id1344440">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2129995">
<para id="fs-id1171105491944"><newline /><media id="fs-id2171528" alt="Gambar nganggo blok kanggo nuduhake soal panambahan 6 + 8.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_011_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1608773">Sabanjure, ayo nggambarake panambahan wilangan rong digit nganggo model.
</para><example id="fs-id1392030"><exercise id="fs-id1939376"><problem id="fs-id1243266">
<para id="fs-id1372968">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1966628">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="eip-id2450011"><m:math><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:math> tegese gunggung 17 lan 26.</para>
<table id="eip-93" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki ana telung kolom. Kolom kiwa ing baris kapisan tulisane 'gambarna 17 nganggo model'. Kolom tengah tulisane '1 puluhan lan 7 satuan', kolom tengen nuduhake siji batang isi 10 blok lan 7 blok satuan. Baris sabanjure tulisane 'gambarna 26 nganggo model'; kolom tengah tulisane '2 puluhan lan 6 satuan', lan kolom tengen nuduhake 2 batang puluhan sing ditumpuk lan enem blok satuan. Baris sabanjure tulisane 'gabungna'; kolom tengah tulisane '3 puluhan lan 13 satuan', lan kolom tengen nuduhake 3 batang puluhan lan rong klompok blok satuan, kabeh ana 13. Baris pungkasan tulisane 'ijolna 10 satuan karo 1 puluhan', banjur nuduhake 4 batang puluhan lan 3 blok satuan."><label />
<tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna 17 nganggo model.</entry>
    <entry>1 puluhan lan 7 satuan</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289477492" alt="Gambar nuduhake klompok 10 blok ing kiwa lan klompok 7 blok satuan ing tengen."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_018_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna 26 nganggo model.</entry>
    <entry>2 puluhan lan 6 satuan</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289477512" alt="Gambar nuduhake rong klompok, saben klompok ana 10 kothak kanthi bingkai ing kiwa, lan 6 kothak satuan kanthi bingkai ing tengen."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_018_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gabungna.</entry>
    <entry>3 puluhan lan 13 satuan</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289744408" alt="Gambar nuduhake telung klompok, saben klompok ana 10 blok kanthi bingkai ing kiwa, lan 13 blok satuan kanthi bingkai ing tengen. Sepuluh kothak satuan ing tengen wernane abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_018_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Ijolna 10 satuan karo 1 puluhan.</entry>
    <entry>4 puluhan lan 3 satuan<newline />
    <m:math><m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289429860" alt="Gambar nuduhake barisan persegi: telung baris isi sepuluh persegi biru enom saben baris, lan siji baris isi sepuluh persegi abang ing ngisore. Ing tengen ana telung persegi biru enom maneh, disusun horisontal."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_018_img-05.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kita wis nuduhake yen <m:math><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry />
    <entry />
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1321704" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2137714">
<problem id="fs-id2645041">
<para id="fs-id1951300">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2483638">
<para id="fs-id1171105493268"><newline /><media id="fs-id1546073" alt="Gambar 15 + 27 = 42 nganggo blok basis-10 sing nuduhake patang puluhan lan rong satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_014_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1470537" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2813270">
<problem id="fs-id2379322">
<para id="fs-id2845299">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>29</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2267850">
<para id="fs-id1171105192135"><newline /><media id="fs-id2197659" alt="Gambar nuduhake panambahan 16 + 29 = 45 nganggo blok basis-10. Patang baris isi sepuluh blok saben baris makili 40, lan limang blok satuan makili 5, dadi gunggunge 45. Asile ditulis ing ngisor blok.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_015_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section><section id="fs-id1385496"><title>Nambah Wilangan Cacah Tanpa Model</title><para id="fs-id2629808">Sawise nganggo model kanggo nambah wilangan, saiki kita bisa nambah tanpa model. Sadurunge, priksa dhisik apa kowe wis nguwasani kabeh fakta panambahan siji digit. Fakta wilangan kuwi dibutuhake nalika nambah wilangan sing luwih gedhé.</para>
<para id="fs-id2137623">Bayangna kowe ngisi <link target-id="fs-id2300206" /> kanthi nambahake saben wilangan baris ing kiwa karo saben wilangan kolom ing ndhuwur. Priksa apa kowe entuk saben gunggung sing ditampilake. Yen kangelan, gawea modele. Fakta wilangan sing durung kowe kuwasani perlu dieling-eling supaya bisa kokanggo kanthi cepet lan trep nalika nambah wilangan sing luwih gedhé.</para>
<table id="fs-id2300206" class="column-header">
<tgroup cols="11"><thead>
  <row valign="middle">
    <entry align="center">+</entry>
    <entry align="center">0</entry>
    <entry align="center">1</entry>
    <entry align="center">2</entry>
    <entry align="center">3</entry>
    <entry align="center">4</entry>
    <entry align="center">5</entry>
