<exercise id="fs-id1606377">
<problem id="fs-id1835123">
<para id="fs-id1785250">gunggung kabeh <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>628</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>77</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1944908">
<para id="fs-id1509499"><m:math><m:mn>628</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>77</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>705</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1614332">
<problem id="fs-id2619707">
<para id="fs-id2174343">gunggung kabeh <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>593</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>79</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2281219">
<problem id="fs-id2129977">
<para id="fs-id2265450"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1,482</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditambahake marang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>915</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2144836">
<para id="fs-id2264496"><m:math><m:mn>915</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1,482</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2,397</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1159676">
<problem id="fs-id2478495">
<para id="fs-id1786725"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2,719</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditambahake marang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>682</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1458706"><emphasis effect="bold">Nganggo Panambahan Wilangan Cacah ing Kahanan Nyata</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-222">Ing gladhen iki, rampungna masalahe.</para><exercise id="fs-id2195542">
<problem id="fs-id1760965">
<para id="fs-id1747338"><emphasis effect="bold">Ndandani omah</emphasis> Sophia ndandani pawone lan tuku kompor, oven gelombang mikro, lan mesin pangumbah piring anyar. Regane kompor kuwi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$1,100</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> regane oven gelombang mikro <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$250</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan regane mesin pangumbah piring <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$525</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung regane telung piranti kuwi?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1801474">
<para id="fs-id1408146">Kabeh regane $1,875.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2452678">
<problem id="fs-id2788930">
<para id="fs-id2214138"><emphasis effect="bold">Piranti olahraga</emphasis> Aiden tuku piranti gebug bisbol, helm, lan sarung tangan. Regane piranti gebug kuwi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$299</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> regane helm <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$35</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan regane sarung tangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$68</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung regane kabeh piranti olahraga Aiden?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2264366">
<problem id="fs-id2135940">
<para id="fs-id1968068"><emphasis effect="bold">Numpak sepedha</emphasis> Ethan numpak sepedha adohe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Senen, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Selasa, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Rebo, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Jemuwah, lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>68</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Setu. Pira gunggung mil sing ditempuh Ethan?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1722779">
<para id="fs-id1374526">Ethan numpak sepedha adohe 138 mil.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1401775">
<problem id="fs-id1827632">
<para id="fs-id1739127"><emphasis effect="bold">Usaha</emphasis> Chloe duwe toko kembang. Minggu kepungkur dheweke nggawe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> rangkéan kembang ing dina Senen, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing dina Selasa, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing dina Rebo, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>29</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing dina Kemis, lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>44</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing dina Jemuwah. Pira gunggung kabeh rangkéan kembang sing digawe Chloe?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2609576">
<problem id="fs-id2198580">
<para id="fs-id1835026"><emphasis effect="bold">Jembar apartemen</emphasis> Jackson manggon ing apartemen sing ana <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> ruwang. Jembar saben ruwang ing foot persegi yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>238</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>120</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>156</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>196</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>132</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>225</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung jembar <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> ruwang kuwi ing foot persegi?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2474540">
<para id="fs-id1386098">Kabeh ruwang gunggung jembare 1,167 foot persegi.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1946723">
<problem id="fs-id2375146">
<para id="fs-id1321612"><emphasis effect="bold">Bobot</emphasis> Pitung priya nyewa prau kanggo mancing. Bobote yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>175</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>192</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>148</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>169</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>205</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>181</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>225</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pound. Pira gunggung bobote pitung priya kuwi?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1962359">
<problem id="fs-id1280684">
<para id="fs-id1352275"><emphasis effect="bold">Gaji</emphasis> Taun kepungkur, gajine Natalie yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$82,572</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Rong taun kepungkur, gajine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$79,316</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan telung taun kepungkur gajine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$75,298</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung kabeh gajine Natalie sajrone telung taun pungkasan?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1957190">
<para id="fs-id2164332">Gunggung kabeh gajine Natalie $237,186.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1410524">
<problem id="fs-id2136860">
<para id="fs-id2730706"><emphasis effect="bold">Adol omah</emphasis> Emma kuwi agen properti. Sasi kepungkur dheweke adol telung omah. Rega adol omah-omah kuwi yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$292,540</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>$505,875</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>$423,699</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung telung rega adol kuwi?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2789052">Ing gladhen iki, goleki keliling saben bangun.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id2658194">
<problem id="fs-id2466163">
<media id="fs-id3323886" alt="Gambar segitiga kanthi dawa sisi 14 inci, 12 inci, lan 18 inci.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_208_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id764274">
<para id="fs-id1910210">Keliling bangun kuwi 44 inci.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2130628">
<problem id="fs-id1739372">
<media id="fs-id1920954" alt="Gambar segitiga siku-siku kanthi alas 12 sentimeter, dhuwur 5 sentimeter, lan sisi miring 13 sentimeter.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_209_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1718142">
<problem id="fs-id1800041">
<media id="fs-id1509030" alt="Persegi panjang kanthi amba 21 meter lan dhuwur 7 meter.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_210_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1786922">
<para id="fs-id2599809">Keliling bangun kuwi 56 meter.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2173206">
<problem id="fs-id1945450">
<media id="fs-id1409007" alt="Persegi panjang kanthi amba 19 foot lan dhuwur 14 foot.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_211_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1788660"><problem id="fs-id2220439">
<media id="fs-id1386731" alt="Trapesium kanthi sisi ndhuwur horisontal dawane 19 yard, rong sisi miring saben-saben dawane 18 yard, lan sisi ngisor horisontal dawane 16 yard.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_212_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1462641">
<para id="fs-id1918111">Keliling bangun kuwi 71 yard.</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1321391"><problem id="fs-id2261883">
<media id="fs-id2453797" alt="Trapesium kanthi sisi ndhuwur horisontal dawane 24 meter, rong sisi miring saben-saben dawane 17 meter, lan sisi ngisor horisontal dawane 29 meter.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_213_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2427822"><problem id="fs-id1933947">
<media id="fs-id1727317" alt="Gambar meh kaya persegi panjang kanthi enem sisi. Wiwit pojok kiwa ndhuwur, sisi kapisan dawane 24 foot menyang tengen. Saka pucuke, sisi kapindho 7 foot mudhun. Sisi katelu banjur 19 foot menyang kiwa. Sisi kapapat 3 foot munggah. Sisi kalima 5 foot menyang kiwa. Sisi keenem 4 foot munggah lan ketemu wiwitan sisi kapisan ing pojok.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_214_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2597307">
<para id="fs-id764492">Keliling bangun kuwi 62 foot.</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1960065"><problem id="fs-id2172560">
<media id="fs-id2316211" alt="Gambar iki ana 6 sisi lurus. Wiwit pojok kiwa ndhuwur, sisi kapisan dawane 25 inci menyang tengen. Saka pucuke, sisi kapindho 10 inci mudhun. Sisi katelu banjur 14 inci menyang kiwa. Sisi kapapat 7 inci munggah. Sisi kalima 11 inci menyang kiwa. Sisi keenem munggah lan ketemu wiwitan sisi kapisan ing pojok.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_215_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise></section><section id="fs-id2280700" class="everyday">
<title>Matematika Saben Dina</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1606437">
<problem id="fs-id3217928">
<para id="fs-id1947377"><emphasis effect="bold">Kalori</emphasis> Nalika mangan awan, Paulette mangan salad pitik panggang nganggo saos ranch lan omben ukuran <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>16 fluid ounce AS</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Ing tabel katrangan gizi restoran, dheweke weruh kalori saben panganan kaya ing ngisor iki:</para>
<para id="fs-id1262668">Salad pitik panggang – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>320</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori<newline />
Saos ranch – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>170</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori<newline />
Omben <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>16 fluid ounce AS</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>150</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori</para>
<para id="fs-id2806755">Pira gunggung kabeh kalori ing panganan awane Paulette?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1880768">
<para id="fs-id1548221">Kabeh kalorine 640.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1215287">
<problem id="fs-id2294699">
<para id="fs-id1911016"><emphasis effect="bold">Kalori</emphasis> Nalika mangan bengi, Fred mangan roti lapis pitik panggang, sakporsi cilik kenthang goreng, lan susu kocok coklat ukuran <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>12 fluid ounce AS</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Tabel katrangan gizi restoran nyebut kalori saben panganan kaya ing ngisor iki:</para>
<para id="fs-id1321648">Roti lapis pitik panggang – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>420</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori<newline />
Kenthang goreng porsi cilik – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>230</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori<newline />
Susu kocok coklat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>12 fluid ounce AS</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>580</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori</para>
<para id="fs-id2307453">Pira gunggung kabeh kalori ing panganan bengine Fred?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1567863">
<problem id="fs-id1394827">
<para id="fs-id2270985"><emphasis effect="bold">Biji tes</emphasis> Ana siswa sing mbutuhake gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>400</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> poin saka limang tes supaya lulus sawijining mata pelajaran. Siswa kuwi entuk biji <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>82</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>75</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>88</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Apa siswa kuwi lulus?</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1171103481776">
<para id="fs-id1171105500772">Iya, siswa kuwi entuk 406 poin.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1369108">
<problem id="fs-id1530557">
<para id="fs-id2684871"><emphasis effect="bold">Lift</emphasis> Kapasitas bobot paling gedhé sawijining lift yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1150</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pound. Ana enem priya ing njero lift. Bobote yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>210</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>145</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>183</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>230</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>159</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>164</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pound. Apa gunggung bobote luwih cilik tinimbang kapasitas paling gedhé lift?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm275747712">
<para id="fs-idm278477024">Iya, gunggung bobote 1091 pound.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</section>
<section id="fs-id1405751" class="writing">
<title>Gladhen Nulis</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1408863">
<problem id="fs-id2912531">
<para id="fs-id2267341">Sepira yakine kowe wis nguwasani fakta-fakta panambahan? Yen durung yakin kabeh, apa sing bakal koktindakake supaya luwih trampil?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1604802">
<para id="fs-id1149222">Wangsulan bisa beda-beda.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1827602">
<problem id="fs-id1465007">
<para id="fs-id1379335">Kepiye kowe nganggo model kanggo mbantu sinau fakta-fakta panambahan?</para>
</problem>
</exercise></section><section id="eip-985" class="self-check"><title>Priksa Dhewe</title><para id="eip-464"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Sawise rampung nggarap gladhen, gunakna daftar priksa iki kanggo mbiji apa kowe wis nguwasani ancas bagean iki.
</para>

<figure id="eip-id1168469634010" class="unnumbered"><label /><media id="eip-id1168469634014" alt="Bagan pambiji dhewe mbantu siswa mbiji katrampilan panambahan, wiwit nganggo notasi nganti ngetrapake wilangan cacah. Kategorine Yakin, Kanthi pitulungan sethithik, lan Ora—aku durung ngerti!"><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_AppB_002_A.jpg.id-ID.svg" /></media></figure><para id="eip-id1168466075811"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Sawise mriksa daftar iki maneh, apa sing bakal koktindakake supaya yakin nguwasani kabeh ancas?
</para></section></section></content>
<glossary>
<definition id="fs-id1226736">
<term>gunggung</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1245763">Gunggung yaiku asil panambahan rong wilangan utawa luwih.</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary>
</document>
